# General
.env
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules

# Root pnpm session leftovers — the working install lives in the root store
# (nextjs/ has no committed lockfile). Deleting these breaks script resolution,
# so they stay on disk but out of git until the env chore (see docs/OPEN_ISSUES.md).
/pnpm-lock.yaml
/pnpm-workspace.yaml
/HANDOFF.md